*% Overprint
*OpenUI *Overprint/Sovrastampa composita: Boolean
*DefaultOverprint: False
*Overprint False/Disattivato: ""
*End
*Overprint True/Attivo: "statusdict begin true setkccompositeoverprint end"
*End
*CloseUI: *Overprint

*% Screen Mode
*OpenUI *KSCREENMODE/Retino a mezzitoni: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *KSCREENMODE
*DefaultKSCREENMODE: Normal
*KSCREENMODE Normal/Normale: "<< /ScreenMode 0 >> setpagedevice"
*KSCREENMODE Gradation/Priorit<E0> gradazione: "<< /ScreenMode 1 >> setpagedevice"
*KSCREENMODE Resolution/Priorit<E0> risoluzione: "<< /ScreenMode 2 >> setpagedevice"
*KSCREENMODE High/Alta definizione: "<< /ScreenMode 3 >> setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *KSCREENMODE

*% Resolution 
*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 600dpi/600 dpi: "<</HWResolution [600 600]>> setpagedevice
<</PreRenderingEnhance true>> setpagedevice
<</PreRenderingEnhanceDetails <</ResolutionConversion true/BitsPerPixel 8>> >> setpagedevice"
*Resolution 1200dpi/1200 dpi: "<</HWResolution [1200 1200]>> setpagedevice
<</PreRenderingEnhance true>> setpagedevice
<</PreRenderingEnhanceDetails <</ResolutionConversion false/BitsPerPixel 8>> >> setpagedevice"
*?Resolution: "save currentpagedevice /HWResolution get 0 get (      ) cvs print (dpi) = flush restore"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*% KCEcoprint
*OpenUI *KCEcoprint/EcoPrint: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *KCEcoprint
*DefaultKCEcoprint: Off
*KCEcoprint Off/Disattivato: "<< /EconoMode false >> setpagedevice"
*KCEcoprint Level1/Livello di risparmio toner 1: "<< /EconoMode true /EconoLevel 1 >> setpagedevice"
*KCEcoprint Level2/Livello di risparmio toner 2: "<< /EconoMode true /EconoLevel 2 >> setpagedevice"
*KCEcoprint Level3/Livello di risparmio toner 3: "<< /EconoMode true /EconoLevel 3 >> setpagedevice"
*KCEcoprint Level4/Livello di risparmio toner 4: "<< /EconoMode true /EconoLevel 4 >> setpagedevice"
*KCEcoprint Level5/Livello di risparmio toner 5: "<< /EconoMode true /EconoLevel 5 >> setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *KCEcoprint

*% Image Refinement 
*OpenUI *Smoothing/KIR: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 50 AnySetup *Smoothing
*DefaultSmoothing: True
*Smoothing True/Attivo: "1 statusdict /setdoret get exec"
*Smoothing False/Disattivato: "0 statusdict /setdoret get exec"
*?Smoothing: "
  save
  [(False)(True)(True)(True)]
  statusdict /doret get exec {get} stopped
  {pop pop (Unknown)} if
  = flush restore"
*End
*CloseUI: *Smoothing

*% KMoirePrevention
*OpenUI *KMoirePrevention/Prevenzione effetto moir<E9>: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 11 AnySetup *KMoirePrevention
*DefaultKMoirePrevention:  True
*KMoirePrevention False/Disattivato: "<< /MoirePrevention false >> setpagedevice"
*KMoirePrevention True/Attivo: "<< /MoirePrevention true >> setpagedevice"
*End
*CloseUI: *KMoirePrevention

*% Color Model
*OpenUI *ColorModel/Modalit<E0> Colore: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Gray
*ColorModel CMYK/A colori: "<< /ProcessColorModel /DeviceCMYK >> setpagedevice"
*ColorModel Gray/Bianco && Nero: "<< /ProcessColorModel /DeviceGray >> setpagedevice"
*?ColorModel: "
  save
  currentpagedevice /ProcessColorModel get
  1 {
    dup /DeviceGray eq {pop (Gray) exit} if
    dup /DeviceCMYK eq {pop (CMYK) exit} if
    pop (Unknown)
  } repeat
  = flush restore"
*End
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*% Glossmode 
*OpenUI *KCGlossmode/Modalit<E0> Lucida: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *KCGlossmode
*DefaultKCGlossmode: False
*KCGlossmode False/Disattivato: "mark 0 statusdict /setglossmode 2 copy known { get exec } if cleartomark"
*KCGlossmode True/Attivato: "mark 1 statusdict /setglossmode 2 copy known { get exec } if cleartomark"
*End
*CloseUI: *KCGlossmode

*% Color Reproduction 
*OpenUI *Colorreprod/Riproduzione colore: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Colorreprod
*DefaultColorreprod: Printersettings
*Colorreprod Printersettings/Impostaz. stampante: "<< /ColorReproductionMode 30 >> setpagedevice"
*Colorreprod Textgraph/Testo e grafica: "<< /ColorReproductionMode 31 >> setpagedevice"
*Colorreprod Textphoto/Testo e foto: "<< /ColorReproductionMode 32 >> setpagedevice"
*Colorreprod Vivid/Colori vivaci: "<< /ColorReproductionMode 33 >> setpagedevice"
*Colorreprod Publications/Pubblicazioni: "<< /ColorReproductionMode 34 >> setpagedevice"
*Colorreprod Lineart/Line Art: "<< /ColorReproductionMode 35 >> setpagedevice"
*Colorreprod Colortable/Tabella personalizzata: "<< /ColorReproductionMode 128 >> setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Colorreprod

*% Grays with Black Toner 
*OpenUI *GRAYBLKTONER/Stampa grigi con toner nero: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 11 AnySetup *GRAYBLKTONER
*DefaultGRAYBLKTONER:  False
*GRAYBLKTONER False/Disattivato: "<< /PrintGraysWithBlackToner false >> setpagedevice"
*GRAYBLKTONER True/Attivo: "<< /PrintGraysWithBlackToner true >> setpagedevice"
*End
*CloseUI: *GRAYBLKTONER

*% RenderingColorMode 
*OpenUI *RCM/Conversione colore: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 11 AnySetup *RCM
*DefaultRCM: PrnDef
*RCM PrnDef/Impostaz. stampante: ""
*RCM Color3/Priorit<E0> velocit<E0>: "<< /InternalColorMode 0 >> setpagedevice"
*RCM Color4/Priorit<E0> qualit<E0>: "<< /InternalColorMode 2 >> setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *RCM

*% CIE 
*OpenUI *CIE/Ottimizzazione CIE: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 11 AnySetup *CIE
*DefaultCIE:  PrnDef
*CIE PrnDef/Impostaz. stampante: ""
*CIE False/Disattivato: "<< /RejectionCIEcolor false >> setuserparams"
*CIE True/Attivato: "<< /RejectionCIEcolor true >> setuserparams"
*End
*CloseUI: *CIE

*% Halftone Information 
*DefaultHalftoneType: 1
*ScreenFreq: "37.5"
*ScreenAngle: "45.0"
*ResScreenFreq 600dpi: "37.5"
*ResScreenAngle 600dpi: "45.0"

*DefaultScreenProc: Ellipse
*ScreenProc Dot: "
  {abs exch abs 2 copy add 1 gt
  {1 sub dup mul exch 1 sub dup mul add 1 sub}
  {dup mul exch dup mul add 1 exch sub} ifelse}"
*End
*ScreenProc Line: "{pop}"
*ScreenProc Ellipse: "{dup 5 mul 8 div mul exch dup mul exch add sqrt 1 exch sub}"
*DefaultTransfer: Null
*Transfer Null: "{}"
*Transfer Null.Inverse: "{1 exch sub}"

*% Page Policy Definitions
*OpenUI *PagePolicy/Page Policy: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 15 AnySetup *PagePolicy
*DefaultPagePolicy: On
*PagePolicy On/AutoSizeSelect: "<< /DeferredMediaSelection true >> setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PagePolicy

*% Paper Handling 
*% Page Size Definitions
*OpenUI *PageSize: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A3/A3: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [842 1191] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize A4/A4: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [595 842] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5/A5: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [421 595] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize A6/A6: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [297 421] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize B4/B4: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [728 1032] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize B5/B5 (JIS): "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [516 729] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize ISOB5/B5 (ISO): "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [499 708] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize B6/B6: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [364 516] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize OficioII/Oficio II: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [612 936] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize Folio/Folio (210 x 330mm): "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [595 935] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize Statement/Statement: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [396 612] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize P8K/8K: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [774 1116] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize P16K/16K: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [558 774] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize OficioMX/216 x 340 mm: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [612 964] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize P12X18/12 x 18: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [864 1296] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/Letter: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [612 792] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/Legal: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [612 1008] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize Executive/Executive: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [522 756] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize Tabloid/Ledger 11x17: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [792 1224] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvPersonal/Busta #6: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [261 468] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize Env9/Busta #9: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [279 639] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize Env10/Busta #10: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [297 684] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvMonarch/Busta Monarch: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [279 540] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvDL/Busta DL: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [312 624] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvC5/Busta C5: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [459 649] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvC4/Busta C4: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [649 919] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize SRA3/SRA3: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [907 1275] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*?PageSize: "
  save
  currentpagedevice /PageSize get aload pop
  2 copy gt {exch} if
  (Unknown)
  27 dict
  dup [842 1191] (A3) put
  dup [595 842] (A4) put
  dup [421 595] (A5) put
  dup [297 421] (A6) put
  dup [728 1032] (B4) put
  dup [516 729] (B5) put
  dup [499 708] (ISOB5) put
  dup [364 516] (B6) put
  dup [612 936] (OficioII) put
  dup [595 935] (Folio) put
  dup [396 612] (Statement) put
  dup [774 1116] (P8K) put
  dup [558 774] (P16K) put
  dup [612 964] (OficioMX) put
  dup [864 1296] (P12X18) put
  dup [612 792] (Letter) put
  dup [612 1008] (Legal) put
  dup [522 756] (Executive) put
  dup [792 1224] (Tabloid) put
  dup [261 468] (EnvPersonal) put
  dup [279 639] (Env9) put
  dup [297 684] (Env10) put
  dup [279 540] (EnvMonarch) put
  dup [312 624] (EnvDL) put
  dup [459 649] (EnvC5) put
  dup [649 919] (EnvC4) put
  dup [907 1275] (SRA3) put
  {exch aload pop 4 index sub abs 5 le exch
    5 index sub abs 5 le and
    {exch pop exit}{pop} ifelse
  } bind forall
  = flush pop pop restore "
*End
*CloseUI: *PageSize

