*% Rotate Method Definitions
*OpenUI *KCRotate/Ruota fascicolazione: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 15 AnySetup *KCRotate
*DefaultKCRotate: None
*KCRotate None/Disattivato: "false statusdict /setkcrotatedcollation get exec"
*KCRotate On/Attivo: "true statusdict /setkcrotatedcollation get exec"
*?KCRotate: "(None) = flush"
*End
*CloseUI: *KCRotate

*% Punch Method Definitions
*OpenUI *KCPunch/Punzonatura: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 100 AnySetup *KCPunch
*DefaultKCPunch: None
*KCPunch None/Disattivato: "<< /Punch 0 >> setpagedevice"
*KCPunch 2Hole/2 fori (US): "<< /Punch 1 /PunchDetails << /PunchMode 2 >> >> setpagedevice"
*KCPunch 2HoleEUR/2 fori (EUR): "<< /Punch 1 /PunchDetails << /PunchMode 1 >> >> setpagedevice"
*KCPunch 3Hole/3 fori: "<< /Punch 1 /PunchDetails << /PunchMode 1 >> >> setpagedevice"
*KCPunch 4Hole/4 fori: "<< /Punch 1 /PunchDetails << /PunchMode 2 >> >> setpagedevice"
*?KCPunch: "
  save
  currentpagedevice /Punch known
  dup { currentpagedevice /Punch get 0 ne and } if
  { currentpagedevice /Mode get
  /Mode get [(2or3holes)(4or2holes)] exch get }
  { (None) } ifelse = flush restore"
*End
*CloseUI: *KCPunch

*% Booklet Definitions
*OpenUI *KCBooklet/Libretto: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 100 AnySetup *KCBooklet
*DefaultKCBooklet: None
*KCBooklet None/Disattivato: "0 statusdict /setkcbooklet get exec"
*KCBooklet Left/Rilegatura bordo sinistro: " 1 statusdict /setkcbooklet get exec statusdict begin true setduplexmode true settumble end"
*KCBooklet Right/Rilegatura bordo destro: " 2 statusdict /setkcbooklet get exec statusdict begin true setduplexmode true settumble end"
*?KCBooklet: "(None) = flush"
*End
*CloseUI: *KCBooklet

*% Fold Booklet Definitions
*OpenUI *KCFold/Cucitura Opusculo: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 100 AnySetup *KCFold
*DefaultKCFold: None
*KCFold None/Disattivato: ""
*KCFold On/Attivo: "<< /Fold 3 /FoldDetails << /FoldMode 1 >> >> setpagedevice"
*?KCFold: "(None) = flush"
*End
*CloseUI: *KCFold

*% Fold Definitions
*OpenUI *KCFoldA/Modalit<E0> piegatura: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 100 AnySetup *KCFoldA
*DefaultKCFoldA: None
*KCFoldA None/Disattivato: ""
*KCFoldA Bifold/Piegatura doppia: "<< /Fold 1 /FoldDetails << /FoldMode 3 >> >> setpagedevice"
*KCFoldA Trifold/Piega tripla: "<< /Fold 1 /FoldDetails << /FoldMode 4 >> >> setpagedevice"
*End
*CloseUI: *KCFoldA

*OpenUI *KCFoldB/Lato piegatura: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 100 AnySetup *KCFoldB
*DefaultKCFoldB: None
*KCFoldB None/Disattivato: ""
*KCFoldB FPInside/Prima pagina all'interno: "<< /FoldDetails << /BookletTwoSides 0 >> >> setpagedevice"
*KCFoldB FPOutside/Prima pagina all'esterno: "<< /FoldDetails << /BookletTwoSides 1 >> >> setpagedevice"
*End
*CloseUI: *KCFoldB

*OpenUI *KCFoldC/Direzione piegatura: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 100 AnySetup *KCFoldC
*DefaultKCFoldC: None
*KCFoldC None/Disattivato: ""
*KCFoldC RIGHTL/Da destra a sinistra/Dal basso in alto: "<< /FoldDetails << /BookletRightAndLeft 0 >> >> setpagedevice"
*KCFoldC LEFTR/Da sinistra a destra/Dall'alto in basso: "<< /FoldDetails << /BookletRightAndLeft 1 >> >> setpagedevice"
*End
*CloseUI: *KCFoldC

*OpenUI *KCFoldD/Metodo di piegatura: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 100 AnySetup *KCFoldD
*DefaultKCFoldD: None
*KCFoldD None/Disattivato: ""
*KCFoldD FLD1/Ogni foglio: "<< /FoldDetails << /BookletCount 1 >> >> setpagedevice"
*KCFoldD FLD2/Ogni 2 fogli: "<< /FoldDetails << /BookletCount 2 >> >> setpagedevice"
*KCFoldD FLD3/Ogni 3 fogli: "<< /FoldDetails << /BookletCount 3 >> >> setpagedevice"
*KCFoldD FLD4/Ogni 4 fogli: "<< /FoldDetails << /BookletCount 4 >> >> setpagedevice"
*KCFoldD FLD5/Ogni 5 fogli: "<< /FoldDetails << /BookletCount 5 >> >> setpagedevice"
*End
*CloseUI: *KCFoldD

*% 180 Rotate Definitions
*OpenUI *Rotate/180 Ruotato: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 45 AnySetup *Rotate
*DefaultRotate: False
*Rotate False/Disattivato: ""
*Rotate True/Attivo: "userdict /180rotdetail known not
{
userdict /180rotdetail true put
1 dict begin currentpagedevice /Install get aload
  /aaa exch def { currentpagedevice /PageSize get aload pop translate 180 rotate } bind aload
  length /aaa load length add array astore cvx /Install exch def currentdict end setpagedevice
} if"
*?Rotate:"
  (False) ="
*End
*CloseUI: *Rotate

*% Job Offset Definitions
*OpenUI *Jog/Separazione Documenti: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 50 AnySetup *Jog
*DefaultJog: None
*Jog None/Disattivato: "<< /Jog 0 >> setpagedevice"
*Jog EndOfSet/Attivo: "<< /Jog 3 >> setpagedevice"
*?Jog: "
  save
  currentpagedevice dup /Jog known {
    /Jog get dup 0 gt
    {(False)}{(True)} ifelse
  }{(Unknown)} ifelse
  exch pop
  = flush restore"
*End
*CloseUI: *Jog

*% Duplex Definitions
*OpenUI *Duplex/Modalit<E0> Fronte Retro: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 50 AnySetup *Duplex
*DefaultDuplex: None
*Duplex None/Nessuno: "statusdict begin false setduplexmode false settumble end"
*Duplex DuplexTumble/Lato Corto: "statusdict begin true setduplexmode true settumble end"
*Duplex DuplexNoTumble/Lato Lungo: "statusdict begin true setduplexmode false settumble end"
*?Duplex: "
  save
  statusdict begin
  duplexmode
  {tumble {(DuplexTumble)}{(DuplexNoTumble)} ifelse}
  {(None)} ifelse
  = flush end restore"
*End
*CloseUI: *Duplex

*% Job Spooling Definitions
*OpenUI *KCCollate/Gestione Proc. di Stampa: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *KCCollate
*DefaultKCCollate: PrnDef
*KCCollate PrnDef/Impostaz. stampante: ""
*KCCollate On/Fascicola: "<< /Collate true >> setpagedevice"
*KCCollate None/Nessuno: "<< /Collate false >> setpagedevice"
*KCCollate QuickCopy/Copia rapida: "
  userdict /UICollateDetails known not {userdict /UICollateDetails 10 dict put} if
  userdict /UICollateDetails get dup /Mode 0 put dup /Type 8 put /Hold 1 put <</Collate true /CollateDetails UICollateDetails>> setpagedevice"
*End
*KCCollate ProofHold/Controlla e mantieni: "
  userdict /UICollateDetails known not {userdict /UICollateDetails 10 dict put} if
  userdict /UICollateDetails get dup /Mode 0 put dup /Type 8 put /Hold 3 put <</Collate true /CollateDetails UICollateDetails>> setpagedevice"
*End
*KCCollate JobStorage/Memorizzazione processi di stampa: "
  userdict /UICollateDetails known not {userdict /UICollateDetails 10 dict put} if
  userdict /UICollateDetails get dup /Mode 0 put dup /Type 8 put dup /Hold 2 put dup /HoldType 0 put /HoldKey (0000) pop pop pop <</Collate true /CollateDetails UICollateDetails>> setpagedevice"
*End
*CloseUI: *KCCollate

*% Collate Definitions
*OpenUI *Collate/Fascicola: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 19 AnySetup *Collate
*DefaultCollate: True
*Collate False/Disattivato: "<</Collate false>> setpagedevice"
*Collate True/Attivo: "<</Collate true>> setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Collate

